  "@type": "SoftwareSourceCode",
  "identifier": "GeoPathSampleR",
  "description": "Reconstructs bird migration trajectories from stationary-period likelihood maps built with GeoPressureR. A Gibbs sampler combines residence-dependent departure, a ground-speed distribution conditional on movement, and a prior on cumulative route distance between long periods. Provides posterior stay summaries and sampling diagnostics.",
  "name": "GeoPathSampleR: Posterior Sampling of Geolocator Paths",
